            <ArticleTitle>Delayed onset of polymyalgia in polymyalgia rheumatica.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>82-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Four female patients presenting with systemic symptoms of polymyalgia rheumatica are described. They suddenly developed classical girdle pains up to a year after the onset of severe systemic symptoms, a course not often emphasized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
